{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19285","headline":"酬乐天醉後狂吟十韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天醉後狂吟十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"散诞人间乐，逍遥地上仙。\n诗家登逸品，释氏悟真筌。\n制诰留台阁，歌词入管弦。\n处身於木鴈，任世变桑田。\n吏隐情兼遂，儒玄道两全。\n八关斋适罢，三雅兴尤偏。\n文墨中年旧，松筠晚岁坚。\n鱼书曾替代，香火有因缘。\n欲向醉乡去，犹爲色界牵。\n好吹杨柳曲，爲我舞金钿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}